### Create parent account (happy path)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/parents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Maria",
  "lastName": "Ivanova",
  "email": "maria.ivanova@example.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### Create parent account (duplicate email — expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/parents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Maria",
  "lastName": "Ivanova",
  "email": "maria.ivanova@example.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### Create parent account (invalid input — expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/parents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Ivanova",
  "email": "not-a-valid-email",
  "password": "short"
}

### List all parents (happy path)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/parents

### List students for a parent (happy path — replace with a real parent ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/parents/7cbc56b0-d7c3-47b8-b529-c4fb36486ec5/students

### List students for a parent — parent not found (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/parents/ffffffff-ffff-ffff-ffff-ffffffffffff/students
